n><p>Structure of different kinds of GAG disaccharides of physiological significance.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JBB2007-43785.002"/></fig><fig id="F3" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Schematic diagram illustrating <italic>var</italic> gene and <italic>P f</italic> EMP1 organization. Domains with known binding properties are specified. NTS, <italic>N</italic>-terminal sequence; DBL, Duffy-binding like; CIDR, cystein-rich interdomain; SVL, sequence of variable length; TM, transmembrane; ATs, acidic terminal sequence.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JBB2007-43785.003"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>